From: Rungic <noreply@rungic.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 02:40:18 +0900
Subject: Desktops of Rungic's workspaces load no mobile configuration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In the independent desktop and the agents' workspaces (RUNGIC_WORKSPACE set) Firefox is a desktop browser: the mobile defaults, user agent, sheets and about:mobile are not loaded.

Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-03
X-Rungic-Status: Inappropriate; Rungic session layout
X-Rungic-Tests: L0:source-replay; L1:firefox-installed-files; runtime: user agent in workspace 0 and on the phone (docs/research/97 §19.8)
X-Rungic-Docs: docs/73; docs/research/97-headless-agent-work.md
---
 src/mobile-config-autoconfig.js | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/mobile-config-autoconfig.js b/src/mobile-config-autoconfig.js
index e898a8e..f3e5f65 100644
--- a/src/mobile-config-autoconfig.js
+++ b/src/mobile-config-autoconfig.js
@@ -17,6 +17,12 @@ const { FileUtils } =
 var g_chromeDir; // nsIFile object for the "chrome" dir in user's profile
 var g_logFileStream;
 
+// Rungic: the independent desktop and the agents' workspaces (RUNGIC_WORKSPACE set, docs/research/97
+// §19) are desktops of 1920x1080; Firefox there is a desktop browser, with Firefox's own user agent.
+// What boot.sys.mjs sets lives only in the running process (default prefs, registered sheets), so the
+// profile they share with the phone needs no cleaning when Firefox moves between them.
+const RUNGIC_DESKTOP = getenv("RUNGIC_WORKSPACE") !== "";
+
 
 function write_line(ostream, line) {
     line = line + "\n"
@@ -104,7 +110,11 @@ try {
     const chromeManifest =
         new FileUtils.File("/usr/lib/mobile-config-firefox/chrome.manifest");
 
-    if(chromeManifest.exists()){
+    if (RUNGIC_DESKTOP) {
+        // mobile-config-prefs.js (a defaults file, read everywhere) asks for touch density.
+        defaultPref("browser.uidensity", 0);
+        log("Rungic workspace " + getenv("RUNGIC_WORKSPACE") + ": a desktop, mobile configuration not loaded");
